---@class aws.ecr.UpdateRepositoryCreationTemplateRequest
---@field prefix aws.ecr.Prefix The repository namespace prefix that matches an existing repository creation template in the registry. All repositories created using this namespace prefix will have the settings defined in this template applied. For example, a prefix of prod would apply to all repositories beginning with prod/. This includes a repository named prod/team1 as well as a repository named prod/repository1.
---@field description? aws.ecr.RepositoryTemplateDescription A description for the repository creation template.
---@field encryptionConfiguration? aws.ecr.EncryptionConfigurationForRepositoryCreationTemplate
